{
 "uid": "enclave-kubernetes",
 "title": "Enclave Kubernetes - nodes, API, etcd, VIP, Secrets",
 "description": "Generated for scripts/enclave/monitoring.sh (B-07 G10, option A). Every cluster number comes from the control planes' own once-a-minute checks (monitoring.sh k8s-facts) and node-exporter - no cluster credential leaves the control planes. API request rates, API-to-etcd latency and per-pod usage need option B, deferred: backlog 3.66.",
 "tags": [
  "enclave",
  "kubernetes"
 ],
 "timezone": "utc",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 1,
 "refresh": "1m",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-24h",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "editable": true,
 "panels": [
  {
   "type": "row",
   "title": "The cluster, right now - every number green is a zero, except the VIP holder's name",
